{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924660/extras/1a570b797866d4f7553c8bd37d570676.poster.avif?t=1758819487\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924660/extras/1a570b797866d4f7553c8bd37d570676.webm?t=1758819487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924660/extras/1a570b797866d4f7553c8bd37d570676.mp4?t=1758819487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Mine, loot, craft, build, fight, and explore the open world in this Minecraft/Terraria-inspired game. It includes quests from NPCs, farming and fishing, as well as a variety of arcade games to play in-game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 NPCs with quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slime pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 boss fights in 2 variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 arcade games that can be played on slot machines in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchanted items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farming (wheat and animals)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmetic upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 pre-installed texture packs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924660?t=1758819487","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924660?t=1758819487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama